@NotesAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5121

### Get all notes
GET {{NotesAPI_HostAddress}}/notes
Accept: application/json

###

### Get note by id
GET {{NotesAPI_HostAddress}}/notes/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a note
POST {{NotesAPI_HostAddress}}/notes
Accept: application/json

###

### Update a note
PUT {{NotesAPI_HostAddress}}/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "My First Note",
    "text": "This is the note body."
}

###

### Delete a note
DELETE {{NotesAPI_HostAddress}}/notes/1
Accept: application/json

###
